{"schema":1,"request_sha256":"0fa50e899390d38ea837f666540db2e3a09402f907dc2149a460631b98f4f9ae","request":{"method":"POST","url":"https://open.xiaojingai.com/v1/chat/completions","headers":{"accept":"text/event-stream","content-type":"application/json"},"body_utf8":"{\"model\": \"deepseek-flash\", \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"你在为一款防剧透阅读器写章节梗概。读者刚读完《jekyll》的「DR. LANYON’S NARRATIVE」。\\n只能使用下面给出的本章事件，绝不能写入任何后文情节，即使你知道这部作品。\\n\\n【本章发生的事】（按顺序）\\n- Lanyon receives a registered letter from Henry Jekyll on the ninth of January.（Dr. Lanyon、Dr. Jekyll）\\n- Jekyll begs Lanyon to help him, saying his life and reason are at stake.（Dr. Jekyll、Dr. Lanyon）\\n- Jekyll orders Poole to wait with a locksmith for Lanyon's arrival.（Dr. Jekyll、Poole）\\n- Jekyll instructs Lanyon to force open his cabinet and take the fourth drawer.（Dr. Jekyll、Dr. Lanyon）\\n- Jekyll asks Lanyon to receive a midnight messenger and hand over the drawer.（Dr. Jekyll、Dr. Lanyon）\\n- Jekyll warns that if the night passes without event, Lanyon has seen the last of him.（Dr. Jekyll）\\n- Lanyon suspects Jekyll is insane but feels bound to obey the appeal.（Dr. Lanyon、Dr. Jekyll）\\n- Lanyon drives to Jekyll's house, where the butler awaits him.（Dr. Lanyon、Poole）\\n- The carpenter and locksmith work two hours to open Jekyll's cabinet door.（Dr. Lanyon、the carpenter、the locksmith）\\n- Lanyon takes the drawer, has it packed in straw and a sheet, and returns home.（Dr. Lanyon）\\n- Lanyon examines the drawer's powders, phial, and book of dated experiments.（Dr. Lanyon）\\n- Lanyon dismisses his servants and loads an old revolver for self-defence.（Dr. Lanyon）\\n- At midnight a small man knocks gently and crouches against the portico pillars.（Dr. Lanyon、the small man）\\n- Lanyon asks if the visitor comes from Dr. Jekyll, and the man gestures yes.（Dr. Lanyon、the small man）\\n- The visitor glances back at a policeman and hurries inside.（the small man、the policeman）\\n- Lanyon sees the visitor clearly for the first time and is struck by his appearance.（Dr. Lanyon、the small man）\\n- Hyde enters Lanyon's house and urgently asks if he has it（Dr. Lanyon、the man in the middle）\\n- Lanyon rebukes Hyde for forgetting they are unacquainted（Dr. Lanyon、the man in the middle）\\n- Hyde says he comes at the instance of Dr. Henry Jekyll（the man in the middle、Dr. Jekyll）\\n- Lanyon points Hyde to the drawer holding the package（Dr. Lanyon、the man in the middle）\\n- Hyde uncovers the contents and sobs with immense relief（Dr. Lanyon、the man in the middle）\\n- Hyde mixes the red tincture and powder into a changing compound（Dr. Lanyon、the man in the middle）\\n- Hyde offers Lanyon knowledge and power or to leave unwiser（Dr. Lanyon、the man in the middle）\\n- Lanyon agrees to see the end of the inexplicable service（Dr. Lanyon、the man in the middle）\\n- Hyde drinks the glass at one gulp and cries out（Dr. Lanyon、the man in the middle）\\n- Hyde transforms and Henry Jekyll stands before Lanyon（Dr. Lanyon、the man in the middle、Dr. Jekyll）\\n- Jekyll confesses his moral turpitude to Lanyon with tears（Dr. Lanyon、Dr. Jekyll）\\n- Lanyon learns the visitor was Hyde, murderer of Carew（Dr. Lanyon、the man in the middle、Sir Danvers Carew）\\n\\n写本章梗概：80～200 字，按情节顺序，具体到人名。只输出梗概正文。\\n\\n【输出语言】用英文写，字数要求按英文单词计（一句话身份 ≤12 个词）。\"}], \"max_tokens\": 3600, \"temperature\": 0.3, \"stream\": true, \"stream_options\": {\"include_usage\": true}, \"thinking\": {\"type\": \"disabled\"}}"},"attempts":[{"kind":"response","status":200,"headers":{"Content-Type":"text/event-stream"},"chunks_base64":["","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","ZGF0YTogW0RPTkVdCgo="]}],"overlap_groups":[]}
